E1\"><pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>config</code></pre></pre></td>       <td dir=\"ltr\" class=\"entry\" id=\"GUID-1F7709EE-EF5E-481A-8566-865EFE83A541__ENTRY_D7818E1_D7819E1_D7820E1_D7821E1\" headers=\"GUID-1F7709EE-EF5E-481A-8566-865EFE83A541__ENTRY_D7806E1_D7807E1_D7808E1_D7809E1\"><p class=\"p\">Administrators or local user group members with execution rights for this command.</p></td>      </tr>     </tbody>    </table>   </section>  </div> </article></main>"
